{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-5","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形外接圆的尺规作图","englishTitle":"About a given triangle to circumscribe a circle.","book":4,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","contentId":"euclid-4-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a743da73d9b9d4b1bb530c57014fe57b65c59697b72652ba59edcaca24b4340d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-5.statement","euclid-4-5.construction.1","euclid-4-5.construction.2","euclid-4-5.proof.1","euclid-4-5.proof.2","euclid-4-5.proof.3","euclid-4-5.proof.4","euclid-4-5.construction.3","euclid-4-5.proof.5","euclid-4-5.proof.6","euclid-4-5.proof.7","euclid-4-5.proof.8","euclid-4-5.proof.9","euclid-4-5.proof.10","euclid-4-5.proof.11","euclid-4-5.historical.1","euclid-4-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae076f994a735ac0ef4e6897f962773f39f0ce68f7b36890ab92e9befefff189","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"About a given triangle to circumscribe a circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有关一个三角形以限制圆形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形求作形外切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形求作形外切圆"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e3f49e77fc31e8575b2c09d3d66c6ba912109641dcafc5ae753923ba9e9454ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given triangle; thus it is required to circumscribe a circle about the given triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让 ABC 成为给定三角形; 因此, 需要将给定三角形 ABC 的圆圈加以限制 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c368a63b047fb752956c75415ce0ae67ef0af20a0bb23cafbd8d551b33aabc2","citations":["euclid-1-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the straight lines AB, AC be bisected at the points D, E [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)], and from the points D, E let DF, EF be drawn at right angles to AB, AC; they will then meet within the triangle ABC, or on the straight line BC, or outside BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB、AC直线在D、E点上两分为两部分,从D、E、DF、EF点上划出直角至AB、AC线;然后在ABC三角内或BC直线上或BC线外相交。 [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e40d213d36fb6ec49238c288d47fba89efe94c4809e1806ebb058c93b039fd50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First let them meet within at F, and let FB, FC, FA be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先让它们在F时相交 FB,FC,FA连接"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5b14fac1b8cd36e6c02df9cb63ea9f8936bdbdd65290458e9f7959dfd3f9d03","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AD is equal to DB, and DF is common and at right angles, therefore the base AF is equal to the base FB. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD等于DB,DF是普通的,直角时,底边 AF等于底边 FB。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6048058783fff8818e18c9eaa31e6fef2afdec6586d86f3596ae7af64684dd5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that CF is also equal to AF; so that FB is also equal to FC; therefore the three straight lines FA, FB, FC are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,CF也等于AF;因此,FB也等于FC;因此,三条直线FA,FB,FC是彼此平等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0ae92cc9dad9190b2a4c9e86703bea6aaf85c17ed167ea7d75f8ef1fad9fbcf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the circle described with centre F and distance one of the straight lines FA, FB, FC will pass also through the remaining points, and the circle will have been circumscribed about the triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以F中点和FA、FB、FC直线之一距离所描述的圆圈也将通过其余点,三角圈将限制在ABC上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b2876e708a9629b344ef5b3824350247dc053e7cf30f31d382c6c46d6bcfb3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be circumscribed, as ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它被限定为ABC"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9077a6d9dd46c5382ae078ee9bebf3ab077fcc071a9b2a3fb0c11aa50fbae185","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let DF, EF meet on the straight line BC at F, as is the case in the second figure; and let AF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让DF,EF线在BC线上相交,F线相交,第二个数字就是如此;让AF线连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d744dc3c1675ab9774336a4ff4f4e1b76fe88a4a97301b218d432c3138398f92","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, similarly, we shall prove that the point F is the centre of the circle circumscribed about the triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的,我们将证明,F点是三角形ABC圆圈的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25fac55970a1c734d4638f3f888f2bc5aee56a51ebc6e5353924ebc22df1265b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let DF, EF meet outside the triangle ABC at F, as is the case in the third figure, and let AF, BF, CF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ABC和F相交,第三个数字就是如此,DF、EF相交,AF、BF、CF连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87230a54b031cde352cfd48301c9d5bd1a41883b01d368abdba94446570e748f","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then again, since AD is equal to DB, and DF is common and at right angles, therefore the base AF is equal to the base BF. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD等于DB,DF是普通的,直角时底边 AF等于底边 BF。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e37bf1bf4b6c7442b7caca36adbfaae78e4ba5991239e1c3e77f74e8e8cecca2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that CF is also equal to AF; so that BF is also equal to FC; therefore the circle described with centre F and distance one of the straight lines FA, FB, FC will pass also through the remaining points, and will have been circumscribed about the triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,CF也等于AF;因此,BF也等于FC;因此,以F为中心、FA直线的距离、FB直线之一的圆圈也将穿过其余的点,并且将限制三角形的ABC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e11c72b7229c9aa54ef7aa6030e18c9658d4f88b45895eb7e7bfac60c2324ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore about the given triangle a circle has been circumscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,对于给定的三角形,一个圆圈被限定为Q.E.F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fda7586703f21501969fc7d5a3351799f05fd2036926434bfa3b93a8fab49f1","citations":["euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is manifest that, when the centre of the circle falls within the triangle, the angle BAC, being in a segment greater than the semicircle, is less than a right angle; when the centre falls on the straight line BC, the angle BAC, being in a semicircle, is right; and when the centre of the circle falls outside the triangle, the angle BAC, being in a segment less than the semicircle, is greater than a right angle. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"显然,当圆的中心位于三角内时,BAC角,其角大于半圆,小于直角角;当中心相交直线BC时,圆的中心位于半圆,则正确;当圆的中心位于三角外,则BAC角,小于半圆,则大于直角。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ec088bed2fa814c680de3324f370d52e9d470755b602a3b2158598078740edf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形求作形外切圜法曰甲乙丙角形求作形外切圜先平分两边〈若形是直〉〈角钝角则分直角钝角之两旁边〉于丁于戊次于丁戊上各作垂线为己丁己戊而相遇于己〈若自丁至戊作直线即己丁戊〉〈角形之己丁戊己戊丁两角小于两直角故丁己戊己两线必相遇〉其己点或在形内或在形外俱作己甲己乙己丙三线或在乙丙边上止作己甲线其甲丁己角形之甲丁与乙丁己角形之乙丁两腰等丁己同腰而丁之两旁角俱直角即甲己己乙两底必等〈一卷四〉依显甲己戊丙己戊两形之甲己己丙两底亦等则己甲己乙己丙三线俱等末作圜以己为心甲为界必切丙乙而为角形之形外切圜一系若圜心在三角形内即三角形为锐角形何者每角在圜大分之上故若在一边之上即为直角形若在形外即为钝角形二系若三角形为锐角形即圜心必在形内若直角形必在一边之上若钝角形必在形外増从此推得一法任设三点不在一直线可作一过三点之圜其法先以三点作三直线相联成三角形次依前作其同法甲乙丙三点先以甲乙两点各自为心相向各任作圜分令两圜分相交于丁于戊次甲丙两点亦如之令两圜分相交于己于庚末作丁戊己庚两线各引长之令相交于辛即辛为圜之心论见三卷二十五增"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形求作形外切圆作图方法如下：甲乙丙三角形求作形外切圆先平分两边〈若形是直〉〈角钝角则分直角钝角之两旁边〉于丁于戊次于丁戊上各作垂线为己丁己戊而相遇于己〈若自丁至戊作直线即己丁戊〉〈三角形之己丁戊己戊丁两角小于两直角故丁己戊己两线必相遇〉其己点或在形内或在形外都作己甲己乙己丙三线或在乙丙边上止作己甲线其甲丁己三角形之甲丁与乙丁己三角形之乙丁两腰等丁己同腰而丁之两旁角都直角即甲己己乙两底必等〈一卷四〉依显甲己戊丙己戊两形之甲己己丙两底亦等则己甲己乙己丙三线都等末作圆以己为心甲为界必切丙乙而为三角形之形外切圆一系若圆心在三角形内即三角形为锐三角形何者每角在圆大分之上故若在一边之上即为矩形若在形外即为钝三角形二系若三角形为锐三角形即圆心必在形内若矩形必在一边之上若钝三角形必在形外増从此推得一法任设三点不在一直线可作一过三点之圆其法先以三点作三直线相联成三角形次依前作其同法甲乙丙三点先以甲乙两点各自为心相向各任作圆弧令两圆弧相交于丁于戊次甲丙两点亦如之令两圆弧相交于己于庚末作丁戊己庚两线各引长之令相交于辛即辛为圆之心论见三卷二十五增"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-5.source","contentId":"euclid-4-5","revisionId":"euclid-4-5@raw-a743da73d9b9d4b1","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f452afefbcca5d6616841b2cf2fcf01218fc759a9d2a9b66a5e98b58db1f4d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-5:euclid-1-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-5.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"I. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-5:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-5.proof.2","euclid-4-5.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-5:euclid-3-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-5.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"III. 31"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-10:euclid-4-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-10.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"IV. 5"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"ed